Build the public SDK with dependencies supplied by Nix.

Skip the pip bootstrap and macOS architecture launcher (Nix selects the
toolchain), omit the removed simple-viz entry point, and use the public
source license rather than the private wheels' additional EULA.

Size UDP test send buffers to 64 KiB; Darwin's default is too small.

